					You growl at the <<beasttype>>. <<bHe>> growls back. There's a tense silence. You wait, your tail swishing in <<bhis>> face. You hear <<if $monster is 1>><<bhim>> sigh<<else>>a huff<</if>>. <<bHe>> flops down by your side.
