			<br><br>
			<<link [[Next|Livestock Tie Stall Punishment End]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<</if>>

	<<addinlineevent "tie_stall_punishment_blanket">>
		<<generate1>><<person1>>
		The barn doors burst open, bringing in a rush of frigid air. A farmhand quickly shuts the doors behind <<him>>, breathing into <<his>> hands after securing the latch.
		<br><br>
		"It's freezing out there!"
		<br><br>
		You shiver <<if $cow gte 6>>and moo<</if>> in response, your teeth chattering.
		<br><br>
		"What's the matter, <<girl>>? You cold?" the farmhand coos. <<He>> goes to a cabinet in the corner and pulls out a blanket.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Accept|Livestock Tie Stall Punishment Blanket]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
		<br>
