		<br><br>
		You turn your head as much as you can. Remy is leading <<if !$nikiSeen.length>>a young <<nnpc_gender "Niki">> with a white toothpick in <<his>> mouth<<else>>Niki<</if>> into the barn. <<His>> camera hangs around <<his>> neck.
