:: Livestock Tie Stall Punishment
<<set $outside to 0>><<pass 4 hours>><<effects>>
<<bind>><<shackle_feet>><<headbind>>
<<if $phase is 1>>
	You're led to a medium-sized room inside a barn on the far end of the field.
	<br><br>
<</if>>
There are two rows of empty stalls. Each stall has a wooden post sticking out of the ground.
<br><br>
You are <<if $livestock.muzzle>><<facewear "bit gag">><span class="purple">muzzled</span>, then <</if>>tied to the wooden post and left there. You can't move very far, not even to lie down. All you can see is the wall in front of you. Your hands are tied together and your feet are in shackles that keep you spread and helpless.
<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<if !$livestock.winter.exam>>
	<<set $livestock.winter.exam to true>>
	<<npc "Remy">><<npc Harper 2>><<person1>>
	You hear Remy conversing with someone behind you. <<if $harperSeen.length>>You recognise the other voice. It's Harper. <</if>>Though you can't catch the words, you feel a sense of dread creep through you.
	<br><br>
	Remy walks to stand by your head. "It'll be okay, <<girl>>," <<he>> says. "The nice doctor is just going to check you over for any signs of illness."
	<br><br>
	<<if $harperSeen.length>>
		"Indeed," Harper says.
	<<else>>
		The doctor crouches down in front of you. "Why hello there, <<girl>>. A new addition to the herd I take it? You can just call me Harper," <<person2>><<he>> says, giving your head a pat before walking over to a cabinet. <<He>> looked young for a doctor, can't be older than 25.
	<</if>>
	<<set $harperSeen.pushUnique("livestock")>>
	You hear a nitrile glove snap behind you. "It will be simple," <<person2>><<he>> adds. "All I need you to do is be calm and allow me to complete the examination."
	<br><br>
	Something cold and wet smears on your <<bottom>>. You jump <<if $cow gte 6>>and moo<<else>>and shout<</if>> in surprise. Remy and Harper share a chuckle. "It's just a gel," Remy assures you. "Nothing to worry about."
	<br><br>
	Harper massages the gel into your <<bottomsimple>>. You squirm at the warm sensation tingling wherever <<person2>><<he>> touches you, and shudder when <<he>> touches your <<genitals>> for the first time. <<He>> continues to rub it into your skin, paying special attention to your <<genitals>> and your <<chest>>.<<arousal 600>><<garousal>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Livestock Harper Medical Exam]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<set $livestock.seen.pushUnique("tieStall")>>
	<<livestockTiePunishment>>
<</if>>

:: Livestock Tie Stall Punishment Feeding Eat
<<effects>>

<<if $phase is 0>>
	<<silently>><<willpowerdifficulty 1 1000>><</silently>>
	Humiliated, you lower your head to the hay. Its rotten, sour smell
	<<if $willpowerSuccess>>
		nearly overwhelms you. You manage to eat a few mouthfuls despite your nausea.<<stress 8>><<trauma 2>><<hunger -300>><<gstress>><<gtrauma>><<lhunger>>
		<br><br>
		"Now that's a good <<girl>>," the farmhand laughs.
	<<else>>
		overwhelms you. You shake your head and pull away.<<stress 16>><<trauma 8>><<ggstress>><<ggtrauma>>
		<br><br>
		"Ungrateful whore," the farmhand mutters.
	<</if>>
<<elseif $phase is 1>>
	<<if $cow gte 6>>
		You
	<<else>>
		Seeing no other option, you
	<</if>>
	lower your head to the hay. It tastes
	<<if $cow gte 6>>
		pleasant. You eat a few mouthfuls and moo.<<hunger -400>><<lhunger>>
	<<else>>
		like straw. You manage to eat a few mouthfuls despite your nausea.<<stress 8>><<hunger -300>><<gstress>><<lhunger>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	You eat the apple with enthusiasm. You <<if $cow gte 6>>moo up at <<him>> and nuzzle <<his>> leg<<else>>smile up at <<him>> in thanks<</if>>.<<stress -12>><<hunger -200>><<llstress>><<lhunger>>
	<br><br>
	"Good <<girl>>," the farmhand says. <<He>> gives you a small smile.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<He>> slaps your ass before walking away.<<stress 3>><<pain 1>><<gstress>><<gpain>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Livestock Tie Stall Punishment End]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
