:: Livestock Tie Stall Punishment Feeding Refuse
<<effects>>

"Ungrateful whore," <<he>> says. <<He>> gives you a swift kick to your ass. "You can starve then, for all I care."<<stress 6>><<pain 6>><<gstress>><<gpain>>
<br><br>
You watch <<him>> stomp away with the <<if $phase is 0>>rotten hay<<elseif $phase is 1>>hay<<else>>apple<</if>> in <<his>> hands. Your stomach rumbles as you wonder what to do.
<br><br>
