:: Livestock Tie Stall Punishment Other Cow Comfort
<<effects>>

The farmhands start to shock the <<beasttype>> with cattle prods. You can hear the <<person3>><<person>> laughing. The <<person1>><<beasttype>> <<if $monster is 1>>screams<<else>>moos<</if>> in pain.
<br><br>
You lower your head and try to nuzzle the <<beasttype>> through the bars. <<bHe>> looks at you with wide eyes. <<if $monster is 1>>"Thank you," <<bhe>> says<<else>><<bHe>> licks your cheek<</if>>.<<trauma -4>><<ltrauma>>
<br><br>
"Aw," the <<person3>><<person>> says. <<He>> lowers <<his>> cattle prod. "Does the <<girl>> want to play too?"
<br><br>
"Leave it," the <<person2>><<person>> says. <<He>> grabs the <<person3>><<persons>> wrist. "You know better than to mess with <<phim>>. Let's just take this one back and be done with it."
<br><br>
<<person2>><<He>> unties the <<person1>><<beasttype>> and leads <<bhim>> back outside. The <<person3>><<person>> leers at you as <<he>> follows.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Livestock Tie Stall Punishment End]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
